{"v":4,"catch":"這是一款感人肺腑的冒險遊戲，講述的是在祖母因跌倒而失去信心後，帶著她去散步的故事。","desc":"無失敗、低壓力和情感的故事將第一代移民及其家庭成員的經歷聯繫起來，反思他們可以從彼此的經歷中學到什麼。\n\n在這場深思熟慮的冒險中，透過引人入勝的對話進行聯繫，探索輕鬆的環境，並完成微型任務。\n\n這款遊戲講述了一位祖母走出自己的舒適區，無所畏懼地過著自己的生活的感人故事。","publisher":"Rochester Institute of Technology MAGIC Spell Studios","release":"2024-10-31","genres":["冒險","角色扮演","模擬","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.2GB / Switch 1.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fe2e197bcfb9e2245bc660751007a701b9d487639348326acdf664d495f686d5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef11d94373d7934616b0a85c8268171148a42d9ef166bc645d8616c4272d04ed.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/61fc878717f4c7267b727ada17a96a2d18c58e36055a815e925e628319ed5005.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c3c4114b1668b12b462c6efe405106bac704944fe093863dfd1b1ee5b221d056.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/709b8e734cf6a4a196d2614e94946eb03ce95b090c4d9ee74f3308971f018b3e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aba641dbc7d047e03cf52b067142d40e2fb13109dda4505fd164f18065c5e302.jpg"],"titleId":"010097501dbcc000","dlc":[]}